Loan Calculator (C++ CLI)

Project Overview
----------------
This is a simple C++ loan/EMI calculator that works in the command line.
It can calculate monthly payments (EMI), total interest, and loan balances.

Refactor Highlights:
- Checks for invalid or negative input
- Uses config.txt for default settings
- Uses safe math with long double to avoid overflow
- Code is organized in separate files (Loan class)
- Includes GoogleTest unit tests
- Includes Doxygen documentation

Directory Structure
-------------------
legacy-calc-2009/
├── src/
│   ├── main.cpp       # Main program
│   ├── Loan.h         # Loan class header
│   └── Loan.cpp       # Loan class code
├── test/
│   └── test_emi.cpp   # Unit tests using GoogleTest
├── config.txt         # Default loan settings
├── docs/              # Doxygen HTML documentation
├── Doxyfile           # Doxygen configuration
├── README.txt         # This file
└── REPORT.pdf         # Assignment report

Features
--------
- Calculate monthly payment (EMI)
- Calculate total interest
- Calculate loan balance after some payments
- Works with long loan periods without errors
- Validates input to prevent mistakes
- Can read default values from config.txt

Build Instructions
------------------
To build the project:

# Using make
make

# Or manually
g++ -std=c++11 src/*.cpp -o calc

Command-Line Usage
-----------------
Example: Calculate monthly payment for a $100,000 loan at 12% interest for 360 months:

./calc -cp -a 100000 -i 12 -N 360

Options
-------
-a     Loan amount                     Example: -a 100000
-ai    Initial payment (default 0.0)  Example: -ai 5000
-i     Annual interest rate (%)        Example: -i 12
-N     Loan period in months           Example: -N 360
-n     Number of months passed        Example: -n 32
-p     Monthly payment                 Example: -p 1200
-of    Loan opening fee (fixed)        Example: -of 100
-op    Loan opening fee (%)            Example: -op 2.5

Calculation Modes (choose only one)
----------------------------------
-cp    Calculate monthly payment
-ca    Calculate loan amount
-ci    Calculate total interest
-cn    Calculate number of payments
-cb    Calculate balance after payments

Help Options
------------
-h, -help, --h, --help, -?     Show help message

Configuration File
------------------
config.txt can set default values like:
- Interest rate
- Opening fees
- Other loan settings

Unit Tests
----------
Tests are provided using GoogleTest:
- EMI calculation
- Input validation
- Long loan periods

To run tests:

g++ -std=c++11 -isystem <gtest_include_path> -pthread test/test_emi.cpp src/*.cpp -o test_calc
./test_calc

Doxygen Documentation
---------------------
Doxygen comments are in the code. Generate HTML docs:

doxygen Doxyfile

Docs are in the docs/ folder.

